      "context": "Whether filter_overdue should use Task.is_overdue() or compare due_date directly",
      "choice": "Compare due_date directly in the store method",
      "rationale": "is_overdue(deadline) takes an explicit deadline parameter, not the task own due_date. Using due_date directly is clearer and avoids coupling the store filter to a method designed for a different use case."
